# Posts

::summary
The Posts surface (product/brand name Surf Grow — every UI STRING says Posts, RULED 08-05) in the shell wrapper: the queue in list and week views behind a List ⇄ Week segmented-control, six-status vocabulary (Draft · Pending review · Scheduled · Posting · Posted · Failed), media chip + count in row meta, the Accounts management view, and the post detail with Media section and per-target Attempts timeline — the mockup accounts and post-detail surfaces fold into named sections here. Compose lives in `post-compose.surf`. Entry = hub destination (hub-sheet row after Devices + wide-sidebar hub group) — Posts is NOT a fifth tab; a pending review item marks the hub row `unread=true` (right-side blue dot).
::

