Status pills tint per state (pending=accent, posting=orange, posted=green, failed=red). The ＋ anywhere on a Posts screen is the create-menu fast path into the composer. Title-row actions are icon-only (G3 pass, WP-N3 08-11): New post rides the ＋, Accounts the users glyph — old labels as `aria-label`, verbs unchanged. At mobile width the icon-only New post / Accounts pair and the List⇄Week segmented-control sit INLINE with the "Posts" title; the top bar keeps only the workspace chip and Search.

## Queue — week view

The segmented-control swaps the list for a 7-day grid; post chips sit in their day cell (time + excerpt, accent-tinted) and open the post detail. The grid reflows to 2 columns at mobile width.

::segmented-control[name=posts-view-week action=setPostsView active=week size=compact]
- list "List"
- week "Week"
::

| Mon 03 | Tue 04 | Wed 05 | Thu 06 | Fri 07 | Sat 08 | Sun 09 |
|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|
| — | — | — | 9:00 · 1.6.1 ships | 11:30 · Phone demo | — | — |

## Accounts (folded view)

Admin-only management; members see it read-only. Circled icon-only back returns to the queue. Connected rows carry token-health, cadence cap, and a trailing Disconnect. Available rows are OAuth connect paths; pending platforms are honest state cards — SHOWN with reason, never hidden (parity canon).

