Connecting and disconnecting accounts is owner/admin-only; members compose and submit for review.

## Post detail (folded view)

Circled icon-only back to the queue. Status pill in the detail bar; Reject/Approve appear on `pending_review` for admins. Media renders as its own section between the body and the attempts.

:::toolbar
- button[icon=chevron-left style=circled action=backToPosts tooltip="Back to Posts"]
- text[value="Post — Pending review"]
- spacer
- button[label="Edit" action=editPost]
- button[label="Cancel" action=cancelPost]
- button[label="Reject" action=rejectPost]
- button[label="Approve" style=primary action=approvePost]
:::

:::toolbar
