:::

:::row[icon=task href=#]
Bluesky
Will post Thu 9:00 AM · queued
:::

:::row[icon=task state=held href=#]
Fediverse
Held — pending review
:::

Attempt node color tracks state (green = live/queued, faint = held); posted attempts carry the live link as the row's trailing chip. Submit-for-review notifies admins with a deep link here. The folded Accounts and Post detail views mount in the same wrapper pane as the queue (back returns to it); they are sections of this surface, not separate routes.

## Renderer notes (consciously deferred)

- Status pills render as leading row-meta text; the tinted pill treatment (`::badge`) is deferred to the block round.
- The week grid renders as a 7-column table; a calendar-week block with clickable day-cell chips is deliberately NOT proposed for v1.
- Row media chips ("1 media") are meta text; the image/video glyph + count chip is renderer polish.
- Live-link chips on posted attempts exceed one trailing-action label; meta text stands in.
